      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get the electrical stuff explanation, but it's way too consistent for it to be just luck. like it's not just a random glitch, it happens the exact second i feel my heart rate go up. it's almost like there's a frequency or an aura around me that's reacting to my internal state. do you think there's any way to actually control or stabilize that energy so i don't keep causing disruptions at the office?",
