      "content": "i've tried breathing and stuff, but it feels like more than just stress. it feels like my internal frequency is just too high for the environment right now. i'm worried that if i don't learn how to ground my aura or stabilize this output, i'm going to end up breaking something expensive or making a scene. are there any specific energy management techniques or ways to shield my personal field so this doesn't happen in public?",
